  "notes": "Letterhead (organisation name letter-spaced, tagline, address) is furniture, not a heading. The BILL TO and SHIP TO boxes sit side by side; reading order is the whole left box, then the whole right box. The box labels BILL TO / SHIP TO are labels, not headings. The first table (invoice number, dates) and the bank table are key/value tables with no header row. In the items table the Subtotal, VAT, Carriage and Total labels span five columns and are repeated in each covered cell. The footer line and the page number are CSS page-margin boxes."
